<div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose about">
  <p class="lead">The place you send a friend who just asked, "wait, Black Lotus is legal?"</p>

  <h2>Who runs it</h2>
  <p>Players, in our spare time. No ads, no tracking, no sponsors.</p>

  <h2>The official word</h2>
  <p>The rules and the points list belong to the Canlander Council at <a href="{{ site.official.home }}">canadianhighlander.ca</a>. If we ever disagree with them, they're right. Canlander.org isn't affiliated with Wizards of the Coast.</p>

  <h2>Found a problem?</h2>
  <p>Dead link, missing resource, something wrong: say so in the <a href="{{ site.discord }}">Discord</a>.</p>

  <h2>Thanks</h2>
  <p>To the Victoria players who started this in 1999, to <a href="/council/">the council</a>, and to everyone running weeklies, recording podcasts and logging results.</p>
</div>
